(7589138, 1222922, 87808, '<td valign="top">Such a fantastic shot, this could have been stunning if a little more contrast had been added.  The plane sort of blends in with all the other grey overtones here.</td>', 'Such a fantastic shot, this could have been stunning if a little more contrast had been added.  The plane sort of blends in with all the other grey overtones here.', '2018-08-04 02:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589139, 1221107, 87808, '<td valign="top">Initially, I was like , hmm it is okay.  Then when I was gong to the next picture in the challenge, I glimpsed you little man in the corner. That changed it for me. It was a lit more interesting. But then I thought, if only you had cropped it to the white line of pavement where he is, he would have stood out more. Would take out the metal plates, but I think it would have much more impact. But that is OMP.</td>', 'Initially, I was like , hmm it is okay.  Then when I was gong to the next picture in the challenge, I glimpsed you little man in the corner. That changed it for me. It was a lit more interesting. But then I thought, if only you had cropped it to the white line of pavement where he is, he would have stood out more. Would take out the metal plates, but I think it would have much more impact. But that is OMP.', '2018-08-04 02:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589140, 1222056, 87808, '<td valign="top">Blackberries already in season!!!!  This is an amazing shot, crisp clean, 9</td>', 'Blackberries already in season!!!!  This is an amazing shot, crisp clean, 9', '2018-08-04 02:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589141, 1222740, 87808, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what you are going for here. But if you wanted to really impact people, turning it black and white with severe structure, would have made this quite sinister.  And I think people would have a higher score for it. As it is, it is just a wood pile.</td>', 'I am not sure what you are going for here. But if you wanted to really impact people, turning it black and white with severe structure, would have made this quite sinister.  And I think people would have a higher score for it. As it is, it is just a wood pile.', '2018-08-04 02:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589142, 1222679, 87808, '<td valign="top">Simply Simple. Love it.</td>', 'Simply Simple. Love it.', '2018-08-04 02:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589143, 1221688, 87808, '<td valign="top">Making it black and white with colour, it is not working.  Making it BW but fading it would have worked better, it is just so out of sorts right now. you need that skin tone and water colour, even if it is a little but and then making the other colours you have pop.</td>', 'Making it black and white with colour, it is not working.  Making it BW but fading it would have worked better, it is just so out of sorts right now. you need that skin tone and water colour, even if it is a little but and then making the other colours you have pop.', '2018-08-04 02:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589144, 1221552, 87808, '<td valign="top">Over saturated and too sharp. Especially with the title, if the greens and hills had been subdued and some contrast thrown in with a bit of soft focus, then it would have worked. But it feels very jagged. But then that is my thoughts.</td>', 'Over saturated and too sharp. Especially with the title, if the greens and hills had been subdued and some contrast thrown in with a bit of soft focus, then it would have worked. But it feels very jagged. But then that is my thoughts.', '2018-08-04 02:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589146, 1222800, 87808, '<td valign="top">This is splendid, so crisp and sharp. Maybe just a tiny bit of softening on that right petal to counteract the sharpness of the stamen and wasp? But then again, what do I know, I have never shot anything this great! 9</td>', 'This is splendid, so crisp and sharp. Maybe just a tiny bit of softening on that right petal to counteract the sharpness of the stamen and wasp? But then again, what do I know, I have never shot anything this great! 9', '2018-08-04 02:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589147, 1222833, 87808, '<td valign="top">Oh I do like this, it is gritty, without being sharp, it is soft when it should be sharp, this is a perfect processing shot, that confuses the brain into thinking what it should be but it is not but it works so well, 9 from me</td>', 'Oh I do like this, it is gritty, without being sharp, it is soft when it should be sharp, this is a perfect processing shot, that confuses the brain into thinking what it should be but it is not but it works so well, 9 from me', '2018-08-04 02:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589148, 1222676, 87808, '<td valign="top">Just a tiny bit more contrast in the face, would have made it stand out a bit more from the background. But what a fantastic shot, and your title just wraps the whole shot up. Well done on an amazing photo.</td>', 'Just a tiny bit more contrast in the face, would have made it stand out a bit more from the background. But what a fantastic shot, and your title just wraps the whole shot up. Well done on an amazing photo.', '2018-08-04 02:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7589149, 1222059, 87808, '<td valign="top">Such an amazing photo. For me, personally, I wish the fire wasn''t the focal point and in such clarity., .The actors or models you have there, tell a much more interesting story,</td>', 'Such an amazing photo. For me, personally, I wish the fire wasn''t the focal point and in such clarity., .The actors or models you have there, tell a much more interesting story,', '2018-08-04 02:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
