(7590909, 1222800, 31240, '<td valign="top">My highest rated photo ever! Thanks all for the comments!  This is a photo stack of 8 photos using the Helion Focus Bracket Tube, a tripod, and remote.  Then the photos were merged using Helicon Focus. Here is an image for scale from last year. <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1224327" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/31240/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1224327.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/31240/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1224327.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/31240/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1224327.jpg"/></a>  I was not photo stacking last year.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-08-08 00:15:37.</i></td>', 'My highest rated photo ever! Thanks all for the comments!  This is a photo stack of 8 photos using the Helion Focus Bracket Tube, a tripod, and remote.  Then the photos were merged using Helicon Focus. Here is an image for scale from last year.   I was not photo stacking last year.', '2018-08-08 01:10:58.000000', '2018-08-08 01:15:37.000000', 0),
