(7591000, 1222666, 194290, '<td valign="top">this is a village in fujian province in china. quite popular among photographers.<table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by amdprasad:</b></div><hr/><i> i have other frames where the top branches are less. in this frame, i wanted to have the sun burst so i composed this way. Thank you for the comment<table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Whoa  I can only dream of taking an image like this one-day, well done. Also wondering if it shouldve been a tighter crop, Im not sure if I particularly like the branches up ahead, but its still a wonderful photo. </i></td></tr></table> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No I can totally understand why you''d want the sunburst in the image, like I said it was still a mighty fine image, and where may I ask did you take this?? </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'this is a village in fujian province in china. quite popular among photographers.Originally posted by Neat: Originally posted by amdprasad: i have other frames where the top branches are less. in this frame, i wanted to have the sun burst so i composed this way. Thank you for the commentOriginally posted by Neat: Whoa  I can only dream of taking an image like this one-day, well done. Also wondering if it shouldve been a tighter crop, Im not sure if I particularly like the branches up ahead, but its still a wonderful photo.    No I can totally understand why you''d want the sunburst in the image, like I said it was still a mighty fine image, and where may I ask did you take this?? ', '2018-08-08 02:48:44.000000', NULL, 0),
